            "detailed_description": "<h1>DEMO AVAILABLE</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DON'T BUY A PIG IN A POKE!!!</strong></h2></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><strong>JETBROS</strong>, is a Jetpack-Action-Shooter-Game inspired by platform shooters of the 80s.<br><br>Fight your way through treacherous caves and bunker systems. <br>Fly over dangerous lava pits. <br>Destroy everything in your way! <br>Liberate weapons from their crates! <br>Ammunition doesn't exist! <br><br><strong>Easy to learn but hard to master !!!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Already Implemented</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>3 Level (extremely long) <br></li><li>Local COOP mode<br></li><li>Controller support <br></li><li>Free configurable control <br></li><li>8 weapons <br></li><li>11 Standard opponents<br></li><li>6 Bosses<br></li><li>Unlockable arcade center<br></li><li>1 Usable vehicle<br></li><li>Level stopwatch (for Speedrunners) <br></li><li>Savepoints (So the long levels are not going to be too long. ;) )</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned Content</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Another 4 huge levels <br></li><li>Another 8 bosses  <br></li><li>More big guns<br></li><li>☑ Usable vehicles  <br></li><li>more Usable vehicles  <br></li><li>Each level new enemys  <br></li><li>☑ Unlockable content  <br></li><li>more Unlockable content  <br></li><li>☑ Hardcore mode<br></li><li>Bugs! Many bugs!  <br></li><li>Bugfixes! Many bugfixes!</li></ul>",
